  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TCPF: Assessment of the sea cucumber fisheries along the coast in Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To develop a preliminary understanding of sea cucumber fisheries activity in the country (fishers, stocks, market, livelihoods);
To support NaFAA on the development of a Sea Cucumber Fisheries Management Framework for the fishery, potentially including a Sea Cucumber Fisheries Management Plan and a an Implementation Project proposal document</narrative>
  </description>
